{"uid":"11e0a2caf48ce63c","name":"test_degraded_card_offers_a_retry_now_button_with_a_ticking_countdown","fullName":"tests.test_browser_hub#test_degraded_card_offers_a_retry_now_button_with_a_ticking_countdown","historyId":"590f75a39e1eed95b358b161850fc8a5","time":{"start":1791890618450,"stop":1791890636184,"duration":17734},"description":"Task 017 (#5): while a run is degraded the run-detail card must show\n    a countdown to `nextAttemptAt` and a \"retry now\" button that POSTs\n    through the hub's proxy (`POST /api/runs/<id>/retry`, ui_server.py) to\n    the run's own `POST /retry` -- the browser equivalent of `ralphctl retry\n    <run-id>`. The button must NOT exist on a healthy run's card (there is\n    no wait to wake, `/retry` would only 409), and a dead run's card stays\n    READ-ONLY (on-disk snapshot -- a button whose proxy can only ever answer\n    503 would be a lie).","descriptionHtml":"<p>Task 017 (#5): while a run is degraded the run-detail card must show<br />\na countdown to <code>nextAttemptAt</code> and a &quot;retry now&quot; button that POSTs<br />\nthrough the hub's proxy (<code>POST /api/runs/&lt;id&gt;/retry</code>, ui_server.py) to<br />\nthe run's own <code>POST /retry</code> -- the browser equivalent of <code>ralphctl retry &lt;run-id&gt;</code>. The button must NOT exist on a healthy run's card (there is<br />\nno wait to wake, <code>/retry</code> would only 409), and a dead run's card stays<br />\nREAD-ONLY (on-disk snapshot -- a button whose proxy can only ever answer<br />\n503 would be a lie).</p>\n","status":"passed","flaky":false,"newFailed":false,"newBroken":false,"newPassed":false,"retriesCount":0,"retriesStatusChange":false,"beforeStages":[{"name":"_isolate_ambient_task_record_dir","time":{"start":1791890618447,"stop":1791890618447,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"monkey